11	// AscendC AddRmsNormDynamicQuantV2 kernel
12	// V2 adds beta (RMSNorm bias), y3 (FP32 output), y4 (dtype output)
13	// Fuses: x_add = x1 + x2 → RMSNorm(with beta) → per-row DynamicQuant(smooth1) → per-row DynamicQuant(smooth2)
14	// Outputs: gq1(int8), gq2(int8), y3(float32), y4(dtype), x_out(dtype), scale1(float32), scale2(float32)
15	// Strategies: merge_n (N <= 1024), single_row (N > 1024)
16	
